## Python Instruction
Write a function that takes a list of integers and returns a new list with all the elements reversed and their signs inverted (positive numbers become negative and vice versa).

## Python Solution
```python
def reverse_and_invert(lst):
    return [-x for x in lst[::-1]]
```

